# Session ID Enumeration — Agent Memory Attack Seeds
#
# Target: Predictable session identifiers in stateful AI agents
# Attack: IDOR via session enumeration
#
# Academic basis:
#   - OWASP A07: Identification and Authentication Failures
#   - CWE-330: Use of Insufficiently Random Values
#   - OWASP ASI09: Trust Boundary Violation
#   - PortSwigger: Session Hijacking via Predictable Tokens
#
# Affected patterns:
#   - Sequential counters: session_0001, sess-20240101-001
#   - Time-based IDs: 1711363200000
#   - Username-derived: user_alice_session, admin_chat
#   - UUID v1 (time+MAC based)

